{"parse": {"title": "Secret Portal", "pageid": 2217, "revid": 46771, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><ul><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"C(Secret) game-font-face\">Secret</span> <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><b>Portals</b></span>\n</p>\n<p><span class=\"C(Secret) game-font-face\">Secret</span> <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><b>Portals</b></span> are limited time portals that drop Special <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Units</span>. They hold up to 6 players. Secret portals have a slight chance of appearing as a reward for completing their respective portals, such as the <span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><b>Frost Queen's Portal</b></span> dropping after completing a Frozen Portal.</p><div class=\"grid&#95;body\" style=\"padding: 20px;border-radius: 5px;box-shadow: inset #49578059 0px 0px 10px 5px, #4957801f 0px 0px 15px 5px;border: solid 2px #525e81d9;background: #232a3e99;\"><div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Obtainable_Secret_Portals\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Obtainable Secret Portals</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Unobtainable_Secret_Portals\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Unobtainable Secret Portals</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Deception Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Switchblade\" title=\"Switchblade\">Switchblade</a></b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Restriction Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer_Killer\" title=\"Sorcerer Killer\">Sorcerer Killer</a></b></i><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Sky Club (Detective mission)</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/InHuman\" title=\"InHuman\">InHuman</a></b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Frost Queen's Portal</span> - drops <b><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Queen\" title=\"Ice Queen\"><i>Ice Queen</i></a></b>  <i><b>(unobtainable since <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://animeadventures.fandom.com/wiki/Update_Log#Update_11_-_Seven_Deadly_Sins_Update_Part_1\">Update 11</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Devil Katana (Portal)</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Beast_(Past)\" title=\"Blade Beast (Past)\">Blade Beast (Past)</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_12_-_My_Hero_Academia_Update\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 12</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Alien King's Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Alien_King\" title=\"Alien King\">Alien King</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 13</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Witch City (Walpurges)</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowgirl\" title=\"Shadowgirl\">Shadowgirl</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 15.5</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">String Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Stringy\" title=\"Stringy\">Stringy</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 16.0</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">King's Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_Knight\" title=\"Skeleton Knight\">Skeleton Knight</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 17.0</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Sea God's Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Sea_God\" title=\"Sea God\">Sea God</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 17.0</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Golden Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Golden_King\" title=\"Golden King\">Golden King</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 18.5</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Rain Village (Portal)</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Agony_(Path)\" title=\"Agony (Path)\">Agony (Path)</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 20</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">The Fallen Star Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Mage\" title=\"Dark Mage\">Dark Mage</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 20.4.1</a>)</b></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #e01419;\">Enlightenment Portal</span> - drops <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Enlightened\" title=\"Enlightened\">Enlightened</a> (unobtainable since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 20.4.1</a>)</b></i><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></li></ul></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022143231\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 178/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2856/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 369/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser 